WEBVTT

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:32.820
She can turn any situation 
into a good time—

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.906
chemistry lab, band practice.

00:00:35.156 --> 00:00:39.077
What I’m trying to say is I never laugh
harder than when I’m with Priya.

00:00:39.243 --> 00:00:40.995
And she’s always there for me.

00:00:40.995 --> 00:00:44.123
Like last year after I got dumped by Te—
you know what?

00:00:44.123 --> 00:00:46.042
I don’t even want to mention their name.

00:00:46.042 --> 00:00:48.419
It felt like my whole world
was crashing down.

00:00:48.753 --> 00:00:52.340
But as soon as I told Priya, boom,
she was at my door.

00:00:52.799 --> 00:00:56.719
I was a wreck, 
but she sat there with me and listened.

00:00:56.719 --> 00:00:58.387
We’re always on the same page;

00:00:58.387 --> 00:01:00.598
it’s as if we can read each other’s minds!